                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Customer:"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " [ORG_2], an iron foundry with 340 employees producing castings for pumps, compressors and agricultural machinery"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Location:"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " [LOCATION_1], Germany"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Challenge:"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " frequent unplanned downtime of the automatic moulding line and high maintenance costs"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Solution:"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " vibration and temperature sensors on 46 critical components, combined with cloud-based analytics and alerts"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Project duration:"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " four months from kick-off to full operation"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Result:"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " unplanned downtime reduced by 58 percent within the first year"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Challenge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[ORG_2] has been producing grey and ductile iron castings for more than 90 years. The heart of the foundry is an automatic moulding line that produces up to 220 sand moulds per hour in three shifts. When the line stops, the entire foundry stops with it: the melting furnaces have to be throttled, the casting crews wait, and delivery dates for customers come under pressure."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In 2024, the moulding line recorded 312 hours of unplanned downtime. Most of the stoppages were caused by bearing damage in the sand conveyors, worn hydraulic pumps and overheated gearboxes in the mould transport system. The maintenance team, consisting of 14 technicians, mainly reacted to failures and replaced components at fixed intervals, often long before the end of their actual service life."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\"We knew that many breakdowns announce themselves weeks in advance,\" says [PERSON_1], plant manager at [ORG_2]. \"But we had no way of seeing these signals in the noise and heat of the foundry. Every unplanned stop cost us between EUR 6,000 and EUR 9,000 per hour, and the downtime was becoming a real risk for our customer relationships.\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Solution"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Together with the maintenance team, [ORG_1] first carried out a criticality analysis of the moulding line and the sand preparation plant. The team identified 46 components whose failure would lead to a stoppage of the line and for which condition monitoring was technically and economically worthwhile. The solution comprises:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "wireless vibration and temperature sensors designed for the high temperatures and dust levels in the foundry"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "edge gateways that pre-process the measurement data and transmit it securely to the analytics platform"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "machine learning models that learn the normal behaviour of each component and detect deviations at an early stage"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "a dashboard for the maintenance team and automatic alerts by email and on the shift supervisors' tablets"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "integration with the maintenance planning module of the customer's ERP system, so that alerts can be converted directly into work orders"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Particular attention was paid to the harsh environment. Sensors on the shake-out grid and the sand cooler were fitted with additional heat shields, and the gateways were installed in protected control cabinets outside the casting area."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Implementation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The project was implemented in three phases. In the first four weeks, sensors were installed on the 12 most critical components and the models were trained with the data collected. In the second phase, the remaining 34 components were added during two planned weekend shutdowns, so that no additional downtime was required for the installation. In the third phase, the alert thresholds were fine-tuned together with the maintenance team, and the technicians were trained to interpret the analyses."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The first real benefit came only six weeks after the start of the project: the system detected increasing vibration in a gearbox of the mould transport system. The gearbox was replaced during a planned shift change, and the subsequent inspection revealed severe pitting on two gear wheels that would probably have caused a failure within days."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Results"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "After twelve months of operation, [ORG_2] compared the key maintenance figures with the year before the introduction of the solution."
          }
        ]
      },
